# Of a function that was made behind the summaries, and whose role says nothing, nothing is known: a built-in that is handed one may write the variable that only compiled code writes,
# which the call of unknown code that it replaces leaves out
# FORM: Prepared optimizing
# RUN: check-replacement summaries-before=f2 f0 v7 v6
# DIAGNOSTIC: EffectsExceedReplacedGroup 1
# CHECK-NOT: valid
# PROGRAM-OF: bound-function-made-behind-the-summaries.ir
